(7538275, 1206102, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>A great idea Susan and very well executed. The use of the Siggy has worked well, especially from the low viewpoint, you cant beat a good old wide-angle lens. The Flash has illuminated the scene well and your active pose really gives a good impression of someone hard at their labours. It all works really well, nice one Susan.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well. A great idea Susan and very well executed. The use of the Siggy has worked well, especially from the low viewpoint, you cant beat a good old wide-angle lens. The Flash has illuminated the scene well and your active pose really gives a good impression of someone hard at their labours. It all works really well, nice one Susan.', '2017-10-07 07:57:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538276, 1206111, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>An apt choice of subject Marcel. I quite like that you have tried to inject some creativity into the scene with your tilted composition. In respect of the challenge whilst you have met the brief I dont think you have made as much of it as perhaps you could have. Instead of showing the whole of the machine I would have probably gone in closer on the business end, the drill, so that you could more clearly see the man in his cab and with the focus clearly on the man this would have placed much more emphasis on the man and in doing so more fully met the challenge.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well. An apt choice of subject Marcel. I quite like that you have tried to inject some creativity into the scene with your tilted composition. In respect of the challenge whilst you have met the brief I dont think you have made as much of it as perhaps you could have. Instead of showing the whole of the machine I would have probably gone in closer on the business end, the drill, so that you could more clearly see the man in his cab and with the focus clearly on the man this would have placed much more emphasis on the man and in doing so more fully met the challenge.', '2017-10-07 08:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538292, 1205808, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice work, Jeb! Congrats...</td>', 'Nice work, Jeb! Congrats...', '2017-10-07 13:29:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538304, 1205820, 100831, '<td valign="top">My highest score. 9. Congrats on the (deserved)  bling.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-10-07 17:40:35.</i></td>', 'My highest score. 9. Congrats on the (deserved)  bling.', '2017-10-07 18:39:50.000000', '2017-10-07 18:40:35.000000', 0),
(7538305, 1205808, 63218, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the HM Jeb. You shine thru every shot. It''s the camera in your hand that counts.</td>', 'Congratulations on the HM Jeb. You shine thru every shot. It''s the camera in your hand that counts.', '2017-10-07 18:49:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538363, 1205575, 100831, '<td valign="top">Congrats...  lovely portrait... great shooting.</td>', 'Congrats...  lovely portrait... great shooting.', '2017-10-08 00:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538463, 1205808, 97166, '<td valign="top">Woah.. a fellow Moto Z user. UNPOSSIBLE.</td>', 'Woah.. a fellow Moto Z user. UNPOSSIBLE.', '2017-10-08 13:58:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538677, 1205575, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is FABULOUS, Marac!<br/> <br/>Would you please tell me how you got him to let you shoot him?  I''m trying to learn to shoot people I don''t know.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-10-09 19:52:32.</i></td>', 'This is FABULOUS, Marac! Would you please tell me how you got him to let you shoot him?  I''m trying to learn to shoot people I don''t know.', '2017-10-09 20:48:33.000000', '2017-10-09 20:52:32.000000', 0),
(7538702, 1205575, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> This is FABULOUS, Marac!<br/> <br/>Would you please tell me how you got him to let you shoot him?  I''m trying to learn to shoot people I don''t know. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was exactly the same as you (still am in certain cases) the best thing to do is to simply ask "Hey, hello there, would you mind if I take your photograph please"? they can only say yes or no.<br/> <br/>Sometimes they ask what it is for and usually I say "I''m retired and this is what keeps me sane".</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: This is FABULOUS, Marac! Would you please tell me how you got him to let you shoot him?  I''m trying to learn to shoot people I don''t know.   I was exactly the same as you (still am in certain cases) the best thing to do is to simply ask "Hey, hello there, would you mind if I take your photograph please"? they can only say yes or no. Sometimes they ask what it is for and usually I say "I''m retired and this is what keeps me sane".', '2017-10-10 04:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538741, 1205575, 86447, '<td valign="top">Simply brilliant. <br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Simply brilliant.  Thanks!', '2017-10-10 15:07:57.000000', NULL, 0),
